 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "Stan: \"Hey. I want to ask it plain: will you be my bonded friend? I'll watch your back if you watch mine.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Stick together, then.\" They look steadier already."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "The easy manner evaporates. What's left is watching you back."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Nope. No.\" Stan shakes their head too fast. \"I don't know where you're getting this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"I work alone. Nothing personal. ...It's a little personal.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "You show them Wild Strawberry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"We're down to 5 liters of clean water. I need someone to haul water with me at first light. Two of us, half the trips. Will you come?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"5 liters. That's today's drinking water, and then we're boiling creek water and hoping. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"I dreamed Vikram was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Well. My social battery is officially dead.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Hassan sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Never mind the pantry run — we got it handled. Thanks anyway. Water's almost gone — 5 liters. I can't carry enough alone. First light, the creek, you and me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"I checked the cistern three times hoping I misread it. 5 liters. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Vikram always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Got a read on anyone here yet? Who should I be watching? You doing okay?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Same. But keep your eyes open — some people here are performing, not surviving, friend.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Watch the quiet ones. Not the loud — the loud tell you everything. The quiet are either thinking or planning, and you can't tell which until it matters.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Still on your read on people here. That's my read.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up? How are you holding up, though?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "A flicker at the corner of their mouth. Not quite a smile. Not quite anything."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Okay.\" Fritz looks down. \"Okay, you got me. I wasn't an EMT. I was a programmer. You don't know what it's like, being the only nobody in a camp of somebodies.\" Their voice is small."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Hassan grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "Fritz looks at you, level. \"I told you the truth. You can keep poking it, but it's told.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "Their eyes do the math before their mouth does. You can see the calculation happening."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Fine.\" Sharp. \"You want to hear it? I dug it up. I was starving and your hole was right there. Happy now?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"That again?\" Fritz sighs. \"I confessed that already. I'm not confessing it twice for dramatic effect.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Hassan: \"I've heard good things about Stonebridge. We should link with them — we'd be stronger together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"All right — let's ask them.\" You carry the proposal to Stonebridge."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"About the creek water run — the need hasn't gone anywhere. I'm still asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"I still need help with the creek water run.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Vikram is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "🤝 Hassan is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Nobody says Vikram's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "You show them Wild Strawberry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"About the creek water run — I hate to ask twice, but it's still open. Will you?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"I still need a hand with the creek water run.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "As I said — Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Something crosses their face — quick, then gone. The practiced expression clicks back into place."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "*They've deflected you before. The evidence needs to be heavier this time — one more thread before you speak.*"
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"That's not — that's not what happened.\" Stan's hands won't stop moving. \"You're twisting things.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"...Okay. I'll figure it out.\" They won't ask twice. That much is clear."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Still on that water haul.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Panic is a luxury. I deal in what's next.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Hassan has been stockpiling where nobody looks. \"Take half. You've got the hands for it.\" (+4 wood, +4 fiber to the village stash.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"The creek water run isn't going away — I need help.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "As I said — Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "🤝 Hassan is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"We were just talking. Nothing important.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"No, yeah, of course. Forget I asked.\" They won't forget. They'll just stop asking."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"They took me. The Lottery — up there, on the screens, in front of everyone. I'm still turning it over.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about what's been happening — that was 10 days back. Still on your mind? 'A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be.' We still owe that water haul a proper ending, too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "It's quiet at the cache spot. Stan doesn't say much. Sometimes that's the whole point."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They go very still. Not relaxed-still. Held-still."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "*They've deflected you before. The evidence needs to be heavier this time — one more thread before you speak.*"
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Okay.\" Stan looks down. \"Okay. It was me. 1× Plant fiber — I was hungry and I... I'm sorry.\" Their voice is small."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Ask me tomorrow. Everything changes by tomorrow.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"The plan is the plan until it isn't. Then we make a new one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Alone's how I stay alive. Don't take it personal.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Fritz: \"You. Yeah, you. What do you make of this?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"We went over this,\" Fritz says, a little tired. \"I already told you the truth about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Water's almost gone — 1 liters. I can't carry enough alone. First light, the creek, you and me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Do the math with me: 1 liters, 8 people. That's not tomorrow's water. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You saw it too, right? The Lottery. Tell me I didn't imagine the lights.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Hassan nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Same weather, different day. I keep notes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "\"Do you ever just need to be alone? Like, really alone?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "\"I get it. Solitude's a resource too. Scarcer than food, some days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "\"I go to the treeline edge and count my breaths. Ten of them. That's my alone. Then I come back — alone is a luxury, and also a little bit a lie.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "\"Still on needing to be alone.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? That is all.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"I dreamed Esther was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I sharpen sticks down to nothing at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "Fritz nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "\"Nobody says Esther's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "You show them Wild Strawberry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Don't mind me. Today's just heavy. That is all.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "It's quiet at the trap line. Fritz doesn't say much. Sometimes that's the whole point."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Thanks. ...Thanks for saying that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"I dreamed Matías was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "A warmth settles over the conversation — they lean in a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"I'm picking up Matías's share of the work. Someone should, and it might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"The way I read it — what's been happening — that's still where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Omar nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind? Doesn't matter now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"I'd follow you out past the treeline. Don't tell the others — they'd want to come too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Ingrid sighs. \"I need some space. A corner nobody needs me in. Is that okay?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for telling me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"I work alone. Nothing personal. ...It's a little personal.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"What's something from your old life that's actually useful here? You'd know about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Not dumb at all. The people who can't wait are the ones who make mistakes. You're an asset.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Something eases in their shoulders. They're really talking to you now."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Still on your useful old-life skills.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? Anyway, that's me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Matías always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "You show them Wild Strawberry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"I can't reach this properly. Could you clean it out for me? Please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Every day it's angrier. I need it cleaned before it turns — I can't work a wound like this. Wrap it tight when you're done.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "They glance toward the fire, toward the others — checking who's listening."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "*You've seen the smooth deflect before — it buys them time, not truth. Thin evidence gets deflected. Bring one more thread before you go again.*"
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"You're wrong.\" Too fast. Lucas looks away. \"Just... drop it, okay?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Right. I get it.\" A beat — and then the subject is closed. They won't raise it again."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Still on that wound care.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"My cut needs a second pair of hands. Will you help me clean it?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"It's getting worse, not better. If it festers I'm no good to anyone — can't haul, can't hunt, can't watch. Just clean it out and wrap it tight.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"This one — Huckleberry. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"a cellar full of jars — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Since Jesse died... I keep expecting to see Jesse at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Okay I really have to move now or I'll explode — talk soon!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I asked Omar about this wound — Omar's gone. Still need hands. Are you in?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I still need help with this wound.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"This one — Common Sorrel. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"an old trapline — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"We lost Emma and Rafael this week. I keep setting out extra portions. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I've got things to see to. Don't be a stranger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Luis: \"I've heard good things about Stonebridge. We should link with them — we'd be stronger together.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"All right — let's ask them.\" You carry the proposal to Stonebridge."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Never mind the pantry run — we got it handled. Thanks anyway. My cut needs a second pair of hands. Will you help me clean it?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I still need a hand with this wound.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"We lost Emma and Rafael. I do the headcount without thinking. Then I think.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get back to it. Good talking, though.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"What scares you most about what's happening? The real answer.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "They go quiet. \"Yeah. Me too. The randomness would almost be kinder.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"That we're interesting to it. Being watched means being kept. I'd rather be boring to the sky. Boring things get left alone. We all learn.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Still on what scares you most.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "Fritz nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "They go very still. Not relaxed-still. Held-still."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "*The deflect is a move you know now. It works when what you have is thin. Make it thick.*"
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"I don't actually want to belong somewhere. I want to keep the peace. It's safer if people don't know. Please don't tell the others.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"You look handy. What did you do with your hands, before?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Useful. Everything useful matters now. I mean that as a compliment.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Can I be honest? These hands? Mason hands. Clipboards, mostly. Now they hold wire and wood, and they learn fast. Hands are honest that way.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Still on what you did with your hands.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? Worth considering.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Since Lucas died... I keep expecting to see Lucas at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Nobody says Lucas's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "Jacques nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"I pace while thinking for Lucas, now. Feels right. Feels like the least I can do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "You show them Pawpaw — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  }
 ],
