    "bearerSample": [
     "🎣 Rafael worked the creek — 4 fish, +900 kcal to the pantry.",
     "🌱 Rafael is getting the hang of fishing — all that doing it, day after day, is making them surer.",
     "Quiet mending sounds from the bunks — Rafael fixing something."
    ],
    "giftSample": [
     "💛 You hold Mixtape. Hand-labeled: 'FOR THE DRIVE.' No player. The songs are in your head anyway — you hum them when you work, and the work goes faster. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are live",
     "📖 Codex: Gorge — gives no warning — it just moves and hits. You won't forget this."
    ],
    "rumorSample": [
     "A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."
    ],
    "crisisSample": [
     "SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names.",
     "You camp wild tonight — no hall meal, but the pantry still reaches you through System requisition. Eat from your pack tonight.",
     "The System notes the synergy — foraged a plant new to this ground: +1 field XP."
    ]
   },
